  <description>Race sim 1.9 km — start kontrollert. — IMPORT: TP only accepts cycling ZWO — this file is sportType=bike so Library import works. After import: open workout → Build → set sport to Swim → convert intensity to % Threshold Pace (T-pace/CSS). Power values are % of swim T-pace (easy ~89%, CSS 100%). Set pool length in Equipment.</description>
